IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssc-core`
IMPORT `ssc2-incapacity`

-- Tests for ssc2-incapacity.l4 (ss 30A, 30B, 30C, 30D, 30DD, 30E). Every expected value is written by hand
-- from the text. Money figures (a lower rate of 100, a higher rate of 150, and so on) are INVENTED test
-- inputs: the Act leaves them to Schedule 4 and to regulations, and the Schedule is not in this text.
-- Calendar arithmetic used by hand: 2020, 2024 are leap years, 2025, 2023, 2022 and 1900 are not, 2000 is.
-- 10 January + 57 days = 8 March (21 days to 31 January, 28 in February, 8 in March).

§ `Tests -- fixtures`

GIVEN pa IS A DATE
GIVETH A Person
`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` MEANS Person WITH
    `date of birth` IS Date 1 1 1955
    `sex` IS Woman
    `marital status` IS `married`
    `date of attaining pensionable age` IS pa

GIVEN a IS A DATE, b IS A DATE
GIVETH A Period
`s 30C test period from` MEANS Period WITH `the first day` IS a, `the last day` IS b

§ `Tests -- s 30A both and either (Kleene)`

#ASSERT `s 30A both` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A both` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A both` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A both` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A both` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A both` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A either` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A either` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A either` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A either` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A either` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Tests -- the anniversary and the leap year`

#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the year is a leap year` 2024
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the year is a leap year` 2000
#ASSERT NOT (`s 30A(2)(b) the year is a leap year` 2023)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 30A(2)(b) the year is a leap year` 1900)
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the same day and month a number of whole years from the date` (Date 15 3 2020) 5 EQUALS JUST (Date 15 3 2025)
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the same day and month a number of whole years from the date` (Date 29 2 2020) 4 EQUALS JUST (Date 29 2 2024)
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the same day and month a number of whole years from the date` (Date 29 2 2020) 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the same day and month a number of whole years from the date` (Date 29 2 2020) 5 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the same day and month a number of whole years from the date` (Date 29 2 2024) (0 MINUS 2) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the same day and month a number of whole years from the date` (Date 1 3 2024) (0 MINUS 2) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2022)

§ `Tests -- s 30A(2)(a): under pensionable age and the contribution conditions`

#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(a) the person is under pensionable age on the relevant day and satisfies the contribution conditions` (Date 1 6 2024) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2030)) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(a) the person is under pensionable age on the relevant day and satisfies the contribution conditions` (Date 1 6 2024) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2030)) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(a) the person is under pensionable age on the relevant day and satisfies the contribution conditions` (Date 1 6 2024) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2030)) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day before and the day of attaining pensionable age
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(a) the person is under pensionable age on the relevant day and satisfies the contribution conditions` (Date 31 12 2029) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2030)) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(a) the person is under pensionable age on the relevant day and satisfies the contribution conditions` (Date 1 1 2030) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2030)) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- over pensionable age is a no even when the contribution answer is unknown
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(a) the person is under pensionable age on the relevant day and satisfies the contribution conditions` (Date 1 1 2031) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2030)) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Tests -- s 30A(2)(b): not more than 5 years over pensionable age`

-- pensionable age attained 1 January 2020; the period began 1 December 2019 (before that age).
-- On the fifth anniversary (1 January 2025) the person is 5 years over, not more than 5; on 2 January 2025 more.
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 1 2025) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 2 1 2025) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 1 2020) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before attaining pensionable age: not over it
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 31 12 2019) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the period began on or after the day of attaining pensionable age
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 6 2022) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 6 2022) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 2 2020) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (i) Category A or (ii) Category B: either suffices; neither is a no; unknown is not covered
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 6 2022) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 6 2022) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 6 2022) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 6 2022) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 1 1 2020)) (Date 1 12 2019) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- pensionable age attained on 29 February 2020: the fifth anniversary is not defined, so a day after it is not covered
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 1 3 2020) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 29 2 2020)) (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(2)(b) the person is not more than 5 years over pensionable age on the relevant day, the period began before that age, and a retirement pension would be payable but for deferment or election` (Date 28 2 2020) (`s 30A test person attaining pensionable age on` (Date 29 2 2020)) (Date 1 1 2020) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

