§ `Tests -- s 30A(1), (3), (4): entitlement to short-term incapacity benefit`

-- arguments: (1)(a) answer, (1)(b) answer, the day is a day of incapacity in a period, the number of the day in the period, days of entitlement before the day
-- the 3rd day is within the waiting days, the 4th is not
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) 3 3 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) 4 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (3) limits only (1)(a): a young person under (1)(b) is entitled on the first day
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) 1 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (4): the 364th day of entitlement is the last
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) 400 363 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) 400 364 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) 400 364 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither set of conditions: the grant is limited by its own wording, so not covered
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) 10 5 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) 10 5 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) 10 5 EQUALS NOTHING
-- not a day of incapacity in a period
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) 10 5 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30A(1) the person is entitled to short-term incapacity benefit for the relevant day` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 10 5 EQUALS NOTHING

